<title>CHINA: Trading in Nam Pei Hong shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Nam Pei Hong shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Nam Pei Hong (Holding) Ltd shares was suspended on Thursday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The stock closed at HK$1.09 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
